        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumufiseko vyinshi vyo kuvuga, kandi bigoye isobanura, kuko mwabaye ibitumva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.1+1CO.3.2+1CO.3.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 3:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho mwari mugeze kuba abigisha, kuko mumaze igihe kirekire mwiga, mukwiye kwongera kwigishwa namwe nyene ivya mbere vy’itanguriro ry’ivyavuzwe n’Imana: kandi mwahindutse abakwiye gutungwa n’amata, s’ukugaburirwa ivyo kurya bigumye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ef 4:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ ūtunzwe n’amata aba ataramenya ijambo ry’ukugororoka, kukw aba ar’ uruhinja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.1.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Flp 1:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.16.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 16:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 2:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, ivyo kurya bigumye n’ivy’ abakuze, bafise ubgenge, maze kubgo kwama babukoresha, bumogorera gutandukanya ikibi n’iciza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
